# moe-edge-inference ↔ ODS ↔ LEONES

**Profile:** research into MoE inference on edge devices.

**LEONES status:** P2/P3.

## Summary

The project focuses on reducing memory requirements and enabling MoE execution on constrained hardware.

## ODS fit

It is relevant to the low-memory and edge branches of the ODS capability registry. Techniques should be evaluated against concrete hardware before being promoted from research evidence to runtime support.